<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 22:25:05 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>山间小屋与山谷森林——为《你好，米兹·珍妮》创作的艺术作品。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac969bcd5dab</link><description>&lt;p&gt;山间小屋与山谷森林——为《你好，米兹·珍妮》创作的艺术作品。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A weathered mountain cabin with amber-lit windows rests among ferns and deciduous trees above misty Appalachian ridges at dusk." height="724" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ac969bcd5dab.png" width="2172"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 22:25:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>华盛顿特区机构</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac947b1122a3</link><description>&lt;p&gt;华盛顿特区机构&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="DC institution" height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sergio/6ac947b1122a3.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sergio.some.pics"&gt;@sergio&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 19:59:49 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>绣球花</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac91c6d84a09</link><description>&lt;p&gt;绣球花&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="hydrangeas, one is still bright pink, the other blooms have turned a dusky pink. One leaf is red, the rest is still green" height="1914" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sylvia/6ac91c6d84a09.jpg" width="2554"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sylvia.some.pics"&gt;@sylvia&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 16:55:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>朴素笔记也足够有用</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac915738b810</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你的笔记不必听起来令人印象深刻。写下你在咒语中用了什么，以及下次会改变什么，会让你有有用的东西可以回头参考。平实的词语就足以帮你记住自己的作品。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Square painted fantasy illustration of a mature witch writing loose notes at a tower workbench beside a knotted cord and a shallow dish of pebbles. Luminous fish float near an amber lantern, with a rainlit sea-green harbor beyond the window. Warm flowing gold headline lettering fills the upper left, and a gold botanical emblem watermark appears at bottom-right. Text: Your notes don't have to sound impressive. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ac915738b810.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 16:25:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>互补色——老派风格</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac909f210e74</link><description>&lt;p&gt;互补色——老派风格&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A branch of a shrub with just two oblong leaves remaining at the top, one of which is red and the other green" height="1872" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6ac909f210e74.jpg" width="2734"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 15:36:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今早出门真是太好了，我时间掐得刚刚好，正好在太阳升起时踏上了小径。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac905a973348</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今早出门真是太好了，我时间掐得刚刚好，正好在太阳升起时踏上了小径。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A wooden boardwalk cuts through a grassy marshland toward a vibrant sunset in the distance." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6ac905a973348.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 15:18:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日簿 · 2026年10月9日
